WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.688
A Mains answer has to

2
00:00:01.688 --> 00:00:03.143
fit a word limit.

3
00:00:03.143 --> 00:00:04.352
And the limit tells you

4
00:00:04.352 --> 00:00:05.715
how deep to go.

5
00:00:06.027 --> 00:00:08.429
A ten-mark question asks for

6
00:00:08.429 --> 00:00:10.148
about 150 words.

7
00:00:10.148 --> 00:00:11.718
A fifteen-marker,

8
00:00:11.718 --> 00:00:13.174
about 250.

9
00:00:13.503 --> 00:00:15.404
Two lines of introduction.

10
00:00:15.404 --> 00:00:17.014
A body of clear points,

11
00:00:17.014 --> 00:00:18.217
with examples.

12
00:00:18.217 --> 00:00:19.552
And a short way forward

13
00:00:19.552 --> 00:00:20.630
to close.

14
00:00:20.956 --> 00:00:23.153
Read the directive word first.

15
00:00:23.153 --> 00:00:24.292
Discuss, examine,

16
00:00:24.292 --> 00:00:25.487
critically analyse.

17
00:00:25.487 --> 00:00:27.611
Each wants a different answer.

18
00:00:28.289 --> 00:00:29.466
Your turn.

19
00:00:29.466 --> 00:00:31.019
How many words for fifteen

20
00:00:31.019 --> 00:00:31.934
marks?
